#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Accounting App</b>: </strong>Keep track of the organization's "
"budget, managing expenses and income\n"
"                    from fees and fundraising.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບບັນຊີ</b>: </strong>ຕິດຕາມງົບປະມານຂອງອົງກອນ, ຄຸ້ມຄອງລາຍຈ່າຍ ແລະ ລາຍຮັບ\n"
"                    ຈາກຄ່າທຳນຽມ ແລະ ການລະດົມທຶນ.<br/>"

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Email Marketing App</b>: </strong>Engage the student body with "
"newsletters about upcoming events,\n"
"                    elections, and important announcements.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ</b>: </strong>ສ້າງການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມກັບກຸ່ມນັກສຶກສາດ້ວຍຈົດໝາຍຂ່າ"
"ວກ່ຽວກັບກິດຈະກຳທີ່ກຳລັງຈະມາເຖິງ,\n"
"                    ການເລືອກຕັ້ງ ແລະ ແຈ້ງການສຳຄັນຕ່າງໆ.<br/>"

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Events App</b>:</strong> Create and promote student events, "
"handling registrations and ticket sales\n"
"                    online for everything from galas to workshops.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບກິດຈະກຳ</b>:</strong> ສ້າງ ແລະ ໂຄສະນາກິດຈະກຳນັກສຶກສາ, ຈັດການການລົງທະບຽ"
"ນ ແລະ ການຂາຍປີ້\n"
"                    ອອນລາຍ ສຳລັບທຸກຢ່າງ ຕັ້ງແຕ່ງານກາລາ ຈົນເຖິງກອງປະຊຸມສຳມະນາ.<br/>"

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Members App</b>: </strong>Manage your membership base "
"efficiently, tracking active status, dues\n"
"                    payments, and renewal dates.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບສະມາຊິກ</b>: </strong>ຄຸ້ມຄອງຖານສະມາຊິກຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ຕິດຕາມສະຖ"
"ານະການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ, ການຊຳລະ\n"
"                    ຄ່າສະມາຊິກ ແລະ ວັນໝົດອາຍຸຕໍ່ອາຍຸ.<br/>"

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Website App</b>: </strong>Build a portal for your organization to "
"share news, host a calendar, and\n"
"                    allow members to sign up for activities.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ</b>: </strong>ສ້າງປະຕູສື່ສານສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອແບ່ງປັນຂ່າວສານ, ສະ"
"ແດງປະຕິທິນ ແລະ\n"
"                    ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ນັກສຶກສາລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າຮ່ວມກິດຈະກຳ.<br/>"

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>eCommerce App</b>:</strong> Sell branded merchandise, event kits, "
"or study materials directly to your\n"
"                    members online."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບອີຄອມເມີຊ</b>:</strong> ຂາຍສິນຄ້າຕິດໂລໂກ້ອົງກອນ, ຊຸດອຸປະກອນກິດຈະກຳ ຫຼື ອຸປະກ"
"ອນການຮຽນ ໃຫ້ກັບສະມາຊິກ\n"
"                    ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍກົງຜ່ານທາງອອນລາຍ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:event.event,description:student_organization.event_event_2
msgid "<strong>A Night to Remember – Celebrate, Connect, and Shine</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄ່ຳຄືນທີ່ໜ້າຈົດຈຳ – ສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງ, ເຊື່ອມສຳພັນ ແລະ ສ່ອງປະກາຍ</strong>"

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automate reminders.</strong> SMS or email nudges cut no‑shows and\n"
"                            keep vaccinations on schedule."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບເຕືອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ.</strong> ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜ່ານ SMS ຫຼື ອີເມວ ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການບໍ່ມານັດໝ"
"າຍ ແລະ\n"
"                            ຮັກສາການສັກຢາໃຫ້ກົງຕາມກຳນົດເວລາ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Dashboards</strong>: Create a visual overview of memberships, "
"ticket\n"
"                    sales, merchandise, and engagement stats."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແຜງໜ້າປັດ</strong>: ສ້າງພາບລວມສະແດງສະຖິຕິສະມາຊິກ, ການຂາຍປີ້,\n"
"                    ສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ສະຖິຕິການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Documents</strong>: Store meeting notes, budgets, and reports in "
"one\n"
"                    place — no more chasing files."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເອກະສານ</strong>: ເກັບຮັກສາບົດບັນທຶກກອງປະຊຸມ, ງົບປະມານ ແລະ ບົດລາຍງານໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນດຽ"
"ວ\n"
"                    — ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເສຍເວລານຳຫາຟາຍອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Email Marketing</strong>: Build campaigns with drag-and-drop "
"templates,\n"
"                    track opens and clicks."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ</strong>: ສ້າງແຄມເປນດ້ວຍແມ່ແບບແບບລາກແລ້ວວາງ,\n"
"                    ຕິດຕາມການເປີດອ່ານ ແລະ ການກົດຄລິກ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Events</strong>: Configure events, assign ticket types, and track\n"
"                    attendance."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ກິດຈະກຳ</strong>: ກຳນົດຄ່າກິດຈະກຳ, ກຳນົດປະເພດປີ້ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມ\n"
"                    ການເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Expenses</strong>: Upload receipts, categorize spending, and follow "
"approval\n"
"            steps."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ</strong>: ອັບໂຫຼດໃບຮັບເງິນ, ຈັດໝວດໝູ່ລາຍຈ່າຍ ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ\n"
"            ການອະນຸມັດ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Experiment ! </strong>Did you know you can create a copy of your\n"
"                            database to try things out ? Simply go to"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້! </strong>ທ່ານຮູ້ຫຼືບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສຳເນົາຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"                            ເພື່ອທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້? ພຽງແຕ່ໄປທີ່"

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Knowledge</strong>: Share how-tos, onboarding guides, and policies "
"with\n"
"                    new members and committees."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄັງຄວາມຮູ້</strong>: ແບ່ງປັນຄຳແນະນຳວິທີການ, ຄູ່ມືການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ນະໂຍບາຍຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ກັ"
"ບ\n"
"                    ສະມາຊິກໃໝ່ ແລະ ຄະນະກຳມະການ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Membership</strong>: Automatically link a sold membership to a "
"customer\n"
"                    profile."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສະມາຊິກ</strong>: ເຊື່ອມໂຍງການຂາຍສະມາຊິກເຂົ້າກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ລູກຄ້າ\n"
"                    ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Planning</strong>: Use planning to manage shifts at your events, "
"keep\n"
"                    everyone updated on everyone's whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການວາງແຜນ</strong>: ໃຊ້ການວາງແຜນເພື່ອຈັດການກະວຽກໃນກິດຈະກຳຂອງທ່ານ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້\n"
"                    ທຸກຄົນຮັບຮູ້ຄວາມເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ແລະ ໜ້າທີ່ຂອງກັນແລະກັນ."

#. module: student_organization
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:student_organization.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Point of Sale</strong>: Also possible to sell memberships physically "
"at\n"
"                    booths or events."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS)</strong>: ສາມາດຂາຍສະມາຊິກໂດຍກົງຢູ່ທີ່\n"
